person that can most likely

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.223
make that happen,

00:22:09.223 --> 00:22:11.160
at least in the context of this world,

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.280
that just even having the conversation,

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.720
puts her in a better spot.

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:16.310
- One of the meetings I
had with Gary a Little bit,

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.380
the first time I talked to
him one-on-one I was like,

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:20.100
