You know what I mean?

00:22:42.313 --> 00:22:43.146
- Yeah.

00:22:43.146 --> 00:22:45.535
- What you should do is look
yourself in the mirror and say,

00:22:45.535 --> 00:22:47.370
what do I think I'm decent at?

00:22:47.370 --> 00:22:48.700
