but only if you

00:26:15.210 --> 00:26:20.210
put so much weight into like
the rigidness of systems

00:26:21.350 --> 00:26:22.190
and processes.

00:26:22.190 --> 00:26:27.190
I always say that process
and systems are there to take

00:26:27.470 --> 00:26:29.030
