00:26:32.730 --> 00:26:35.400
how you take notes, how
you do your to do list,

00:26:35.400 --> 00:26:37.440
how you organize your email inbox,

00:26:37.440 --> 00:26:39.490
like there's efficiency to it,

00:26:39.490 --> 00:26:40.430
but at the same time,

00:26:40.430 --> 00:26:45.350
once you rely on the
process over the thought,

00:26:45.350 --> 00:26:48.960
you just become attached to the process,

00:26:48.960 --> 00:26:50.680
it takes a lot of thinking
out of the situation,

00:26:50.680 --> 00:26:52.500
creativity out of the situation.

00:26:52.500 --> 00:26:54.080
