It was like about a month away to move,

00:29:07.420 --> 00:29:08.440
and that's a pretty big move.

00:29:08.440 --> 00:29:11.050
I was 25 at the time,

00:29:11.050 --> 00:29:11.883
24, 25.

00:29:11.883 --> 00:29:13.310
