And there was like, kind of like,

00:29:21.920 --> 00:29:25.080
well, aren't I doing this?

00:29:25.080 --> 00:29:26.423
And he's like, well,

00:29:28.070 --> 00:29:29.550
it doesn't have any impact,

00:29:29.550 --> 00:29:31.230
like meaning yes,

00:29:31.230 --> 00:29:34.320
but this is something
new and new information,

00:29:34.320 --> 00:29:36.490
a new situation, a new data.

00:29:36.490 --> 00:29:37.323
And

00:29:41.130 --> 00:29:42.870
not necessarily not taking into account,

00:29:42.870 --> 00:29:46.720
but not letting, just because
that is the case effect,

00:29:46.720 --> 00:29:51.380
that aspect of taking that role was

00:29:51.380 --> 00:29:53.800
the first like real eyeopening thing.

00:29:53.800 --> 00:29:54.633
- And you don't feel,

00:29:54.633 --> 00:29:56.210
you don't think twice
or feel bad about it,

00:29:56.210 --> 00:29:57.043
something like that.
- No

00:29:57.043 --> 00:29:58.390
because when I make decisions,

00:29:58.390 --> 00:30:01.270
I'm making them at that
moment and things change.

00:30:01.270 --> 00:30:04.130
If I email my direct reports,
my leaders tomorrow and said,

00:30:04.130 --> 00:30:06.090
we're now selling actual honey,

00:30:06.090 --> 00:30:08.340
but we are no longer an
